# Keep the build context to the tree under test.
#
# .git is excluded for two reasons, and the second matters more: the image does not need history,
# and nothing in the pipeline shells out to git, so a container that cannot reach the repository's
# history cannot accidentally derive a result from anything other than the files it was given.
.git
.gitignore

# Never present by design — this repository declares no dependencies — but excluded so that a stray
# local `npm install` cannot leak a node_modules tree into the CI image and make a dependency look
# available to a check that should have failed without it.
node_modules
package-lock.json

# Results from previous runs. Copying them in would let a stale verdict sit in the image alongside
# the run that is about to produce a new one.
artifacts/local-ci

# Editor and OS noise
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
.idea
.vscode
